" volee   1 Hierarchy   2 Network   3 Repos   4 Timeline              ? 2 · ✉ 5 · ! 2 need you · ▸ 6 working · 12 agents "
"╭ ╭ All keys · [tui.keys] in config.toml changes them · esc closes ──────────────────────────────────────────────────╮─╮"
"│▌│ Everywhere                        Agents list                       Hierarchy                                    │ │"
"│ │ '               jump to…          h, ←            parent            h, ←            left                         │ │"
"│ │ -               jump back         j, ↓            next              j, ↓            below                        │ │"
"│ │ /               filter            k, ↑            previous          k, ↑            above                        │ │"
"│ │ n               next match        l, →            child             l, →            right                        │ │"
"│ │ N               previous match    gg, home        first             gg, home        first                        │ │"
"│ │ m               message           G, end          last              G, end          last                         │ │"
"│ │ d               diff              ctrl-d, pgdn    half page down    enter           subtree                      │ │"
"│ │ a               take over         ctrl-u, pgup    half page up      +, =            zoom in                      │ │"
"│ │ z               full screen       enter           subtree           _               zoom out                     │ │"
"│ │ i               messages          +, =            zoom in           0               auto zoom                    │ │"
"│ │ o, ␣o           open with…        _               zoom out                                                       │ │"
"│ │ A, ␣a           adopt             0               auto zoom         Network                                      │ │"
"│ │ F, ␣f           forget                                              h, ←            left                         │ │"
"│ │ ␣n              new agent         Repositories                      j, ↓            below                        │ │"
"│ │ ␣N              new mission       j, ↓            next              k, ↑            above                        │ │"
"│ │ ␣w, 5           wall              k, ↑            previous          l, →            right                        │ │"
"│ │ ␣t              theme…            h, ←            previous repo     gg, home        first                        │ │"
"│ │ ␣k              all keys          l, →            next repo         G, end          last                         │ │"
"│ │ :               commands          gg, home        first             +, =            zoom in                      │ │"
"│ │ tab             next panel        G, end          last              _               zoom out                     │ │"
"│ │ shift-tab       previous panel    +, =            zoom in           0               auto zoom                    │ │"
"│ │ 1               hierarchy         _               zoom out                                                       │ │"
"│ │ 2               network           0               auto zoom         Timeline                                     │ │"
"╰─│ 3               repositories                                        j, ↓            next lane                    │─╯"
"╭ │ 4               timeline          Detail and preview                k, ↑            previous lane                │─╮"
"│ │ H               previous view     j, ↓            scroll down       h, ←            back in time                 │ │"
"│ │ L               next view         k, ↑            scroll up         l, →            forward in time              │ │"
"│ │ ?               keys              ctrl-d, pgdn    half page down    [               previous event               │ │"
"│ │ esc             back              ctrl-u, pgup    half page up      ]               next event                   │ │"
"│ │ q, ctrl-c       quit              r               refresh           gg, home        first                        │ │"
"│ │                                   enter           full screen       G, end          last                         │ │"
"│ │ Full screen                                                         +, =            zoom in                      │ │"
"│ │ k, ↑            scroll up         Filter prompt                     _               zoom out                     │ │"
"│ │ j, ↓            scroll down       enter           apply             0               now                          │ │"
"│ │ ctrl-u, pgup    half page up      esc             cancel                                                         │ │"
"╰─╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────▼─╯─╯"
" j/k scroll   esc close                                                                                                 "
